---
import ServiceAreaMap from "./ServiceAreaMap.astro";
---

<section id="area" class="scroll-mt-20 bg-lavender-tint py-14 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1120px] px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] md:items-end md:gap-12">
      <h2 class="max-w-[15ch] text-[clamp(2.15rem,4.2vw,3.45rem)] font-semibold">
        We live here. That’s why your machine stays full.
      </h2>
      <p class="max-w-[60ch] text-[1.03rem] leading-relaxed text-muted md:justify-self-end">
        Crossbell runs a weekly route through Macomb and north Oakland County. The person who
        answers the phone is close enough to learn what your site wants, bring it the following
        week, and respond when something needs attention.
      </p>
    </div>

    <dl class="my-8 grid border-y border-indigo/20 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:divide-x sm:divide-indigo/20">
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 py-4 sm:block sm:px-5 sm:first:pl-0">
        <dt class="text-sm text-muted">Restocking</dt>
        <dd class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Weekly</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-t border-indigo/20 py-4 sm:block sm:border-t-0 sm:px-5">
        <dt class="text-sm text-muted">Messages</dt>
        <dd class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Same-day reply</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-t border-indigo/20 py-4 sm:block sm:border-t-0 sm:px-5 sm:last:pr-0">
        <dt class="text-sm text-muted">Coverage</dt>
        <dd class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Two-county route</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>

    <ServiceAreaMap />

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 border border-line bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 md:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr] md:items-center">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase">
          Already have a machine nobody services?
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2.5 max-w-[62ch] text-[0.96rem] text-muted">
          Half empty for weeks, card reader down, nobody calls you back? We’ll assess the setup,
          tell you whether it is worth replacing, and swap it out if it is.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="#contact"
        class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-accent px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-accent-hover md:justify-self-end"
      >
        Request a replacement review
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
